15
00:01:34,896 --> 00:01:36,496
You gotta be shitting me, right?

16
00:01:37,264 --> 00:01:39,232
No shit. I'm goin' clean.

17
00:01:40,233 --> 00:01:43,203
Well, that's a fuckin' shame,
if there ever was one.

18
00:01:43,270 --> 00:01:44,672
