57
00:03:18,933 --> 00:03:22,036
<i>They got us on a total</i>
<i>Greek salad of charges.</i>

58
00:03:22,103 --> 00:03:24,438
<i>From illegal gambling</i>
<i>to drug possession,</i>

59
00:03:24,505 --> 00:03:25,907
<i>unpaid parking tickets.</i>

60
00:03:25,973 --> 00:03:27,775
<i>It was a mess.</i>

61
00:03:27,842 --> 00:03:30,945
<i>But you know what they say:</i>
<i>When one cell door closes,</i>

62
00:03:31,012 --> 00:03:32,513
