97
00:04:56,296 --> 00:04:58,099
Yeah, it's about
fuckin' time, right?

98
00:04:58,166 --> 00:04:59,867
About fucking time!

99
00:04:59,934 --> 00:05:01,602
You look good, Regina.

100
00:05:01,669 --> 00:05:03,638
