123
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:58,759
<i>Great to hear your voice,</i>
<i>buddy.</i>

124
00:05:58,826 --> 00:06:00,995
<i>-So, you got my package, right?</i>
-Yeah, I got it.

125
00:06:01,062 --> 00:06:03,631
